  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap ICVP.Core.ConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"ICVP.Core.ConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcICVP.Core.ConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ICVP.Core.html\">ICVP.Core CodeSystem for Data Elements</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-administrative-gender.html\">AdministrativeGender</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.4 (Male)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>male</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.5 (Female)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>female</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.6 (Other)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-broader-than-target\" title=\"source-is-broader-than-target\">is broader than</a></td><td>other</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.7 (Unknown)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>unknown</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-administrative-gender.html\">AdministrativeGender</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-ICVP.Core.html\">ICVP.Core CodeSystem for Data Elements</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>male</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.4 (Male)</td></tr><tr><td>female</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.5 (Female)</td></tr><tr><td>other</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-narrower-than-target\" title=\"source-is-narrower-than-target\">is narrower than</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.6 (Other)</td></tr><tr><td>unknown</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.7 (Unknown)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ICVP.Core.html\">ICVP.Core CodeSystem for Data Elements</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.4.0/CodeSystem-ICD11MMS.html\">International Classification of Diseases, 11th Revision Mortality and Morbidity Statistics (MMS)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.4 (Male)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XX2UQ8</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.5 (Female)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XX2V25</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.6 (Other)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-broader-than-target\" title=\"source-is-broader-than-target\">is broader than</a></td><td>XX45B7</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.7 (Unknown)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XX2PX3</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 4 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.4.0/CodeSystem-ICD11MMS.html\">International Classification of Diseases, 11th Revision Mortality and Morbidity Statistics (MMS)</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-ICVP.Core.html\">ICVP.Core CodeSystem for Data Elements</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>XX2UQ8</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.4 (Male)</td></tr><tr><td>XX2V25</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.5 (Female)</td></tr><tr><td>XX45B7</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-narrower-than-target\" title=\"source-is-narrower-than-target\">is narrower than</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.6 (Other)</td></tr><tr><td>XX2PX3</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.7 (Unknown)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 5 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ICVP.Core.html\">ICVP.Core CodeSystem for Data Elements</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.1 (Name of the recipient of vaccine or prophylaxis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>87226-7 (Legal name of patient - first and last)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.2 (Date of Birth)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>21112-8 (Birth date)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.4 (Male)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>11433-0 (Physical findings of Male genitalia)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.5 (Female)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>11432-2 (Physical findings of Female genitalia)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.6 (Other)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-broader-than-target\" title=\"source-is-broader-than-target\">is broader than</a></td><td>11431-4 (Physical findings of Genitalia)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.8 (Nationality)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-narrower-than-target\" title=\"source-is-narrower-than-target\">is narrower than</a></td><td>69433-1 (Citizenship status)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.9 (National identification document, if applicable)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-narrower-than-target\" title=\"source-is-narrower-than-target\">is narrower than</a></td><td>76435-7 (Patient identifier)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.10 (Name of the parent or guardian)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-broader-than-target\" title=\"source-is-broader-than-target\">is broader than</a></td><td>79183-0 (First name of Guardian or legally authorized representative)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.C5.DE.11 (Vaccine or prophylaxis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>39236-5 (Vaccine code (CPT) CPHS)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.C5.DE.12 (Name of disease or condition)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>39236-5 (Vaccine code (CPT) CPHS)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.C5.DE.13 (Date)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-narrower-than-target\" title=\"source-is-narrower-than-target\">is narrower than</a></td><td>30952-6 (Date and time of vaccination)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.C5.DE.16 (Manufacturer of vaccine or prophylaxis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>30957-5 (Manufacturer name [Identifier] Vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.C5.DE.18 (Batch number (string))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>30959-1 (Lot number [Identifier] Vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.C5.DE.19 (Batch number (coded))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>30959-1 (Lot number [Identifier] Vaccine)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 6 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-ICVP.Core.html\">ICVP.Core CodeSystem for Data Elements</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code