<tr><td>79183-0 (First name of Guardian or legally authorized representative)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-narrower-than-target\" title=\"source-is-narrower-than-target\">is narrower than</a></td><td>ICVP.A9.DE.10 (Name of the parent or guardian)</td></tr><tr><td>39236-5 (Vaccine code (CPT) CPHS)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.C5.DE.11 (Vaccine or prophylaxis)</td></tr><tr><td>30952-6 (Date and time of vaccination)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-source-is-broader-than-target\" title=\"source-is-broader-than-target\">is broader than</a></td><td>ICVP.C5.DE.13 (Date)</td></tr><tr><td>30957-5 (Manufacturer name [Identifier] Vaccine)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.C5.DE.16 (Manufacturer of vaccine or prophylaxis)</td></tr><tr><td>30959-1 (Lot number [Identifier] Vaccine)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ICVP.C5.DE.18 (Batch number (string))</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 7 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ICVP.Core.html\">ICVP.Core CodeSystem for Data Elements</a> to <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code> (SNOMED CT International Edition)</p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>ICVP.A9.DE.2 (Date of Birth)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#concept-map-relationship-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>184099003 (Date of birth)</td></t